window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Forged by Fury</i> is the fourth book in the Demons of New Chicago series. <br> <br> If you can’t get enough of books by Ella Summers, Annette Marie, Shannon Mayer, Deborah Wilde, K.F. Breene, Jeaniene Frost, Kelly St. Clare, and Linsey Hall, then dive right in to the dangerous depths of New Chicago. Beware of headstrong heroines with snark. These ladies don’t bark. They bite. <br> <br> Start the series with <i>Touched by Fire</i> right now!</p>"; 
